<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>P2P 60-24 EVO — Balanced State Report</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: 'Monaco', 'Consolas', monospace; background: #0d1117; color: #e6edf3; line-height: 1.6; }
        .container { max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px; }
        header { border-bottom: 3px solid #21262d; padding-bottom: 20px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        h1 { color: #58a6ff; font-size: 2.8em; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        h2 { color: #79c0ff; font-size: 1.8em; margin: 30px 0 15px 0; border-left: 4px solid #58a6ff; padding-left: 15px; }
        .status { display: flex; gap: 20px; margin: 20px 0; }
        .status-card { background: #161b22; border: 1px solid #21262d; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px; flex: 1; }
        .status-title { color: #79c0ff; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .status-value { font-size: 2em; font-weight: bold; margin: 10px 0; }
        .status-pass { color: #3fb950; }
        .status-warn { color: #d29922; }
        .section { background: #161b22; border: 1px solid #21262d; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 15px 0; }
        th, td { text-align: left; padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #21262d; }
        th { background: #0d1117; color: #79c0ff; font-weight: bold; }
        tr:hover { background: #1c2128; }
        .checkmark { color: #3fb950; font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.2em; }
        .cross { color: #f85149; font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.2em; }
        .progress-bar { width: 100%; height: 24px; background: #0d1117; border: 1px solid #21262d; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; margin: 10px 0; }
        .progress-fill { height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3fb950 0%, #58a6ff 50%, #79c0ff 100%); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #0d1117; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.8em; }
        .metric { display: inline-block; background: #1c2128; padding: 10px 15px; margin: 5px; border-radius: 4px; border-left: 3px solid #58a6ff; }
        .grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
        .grid-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 15px; }
        .card { background: #1c2128; border: 1px solid #21262d; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px; }
        .card-title { color: #79c0ff; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .card-value { font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold; color: #3fb950; }
        .module-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 8px 0; }
        .module-name { flex: 1; }
        .module-status { color: #3fb950; font-weight: bold; }
        .timestamp { color: #8b949e; font-size: 0.9em; margin-top: 20px; }
        .summary-box { background: #1f6feb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 6px; margin: 20px 0; }
        .summary-box strong { color: #fff; font-size: 1.1em; }
        .next-action { background: #261d26; border-left: 4px solid #d29922; padding: 15px; margin: 10px 0; border-radius: 4px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1>⚖️ P2P 60-24 EVO — Balanced State Report</h1>
            <p class="timestamp">Session 3 — Autonomous Rebalancing Complete<br>All objectives aligned • Target equilibrium achieved</p>
        </header>

        <!-- BALANCE METRICS -->
        <div class="status">
            <div class="status-card">
                <div class="status-title">🎯 Phase 1 Completeness</div>
